<title>UK: London palladium fixes at new all-time high price.</title>
<headline>London palladium fixes at new all-time high price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Palladium fixed at a fresh all time high level and sister metal platinum surged to its highest fixing in 16 months as supply fears gripped the markets, dealers said.</p>
<p>Palladium was fixed at $196.50 per ounce its highest level since fixings began in 1989 and platinum fixed at $417.50, its highest level since February 21, 1996.</p>
